{"3379460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crisis Reign Orbis", "steam_appid": 3379460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Embark on the Crisis Story</strong></i> - <br>Play the main story of Azer and travel through several stages, fight against enemies, talk with the locals, solve puzzles and rebuild the support of your team. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras/e5f2588a6299e661a2c0884b9381784e.avif?t=1763336336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras_big/e5f2588a6299e661a2c0884b9381784e.avif?t=1763336336 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><strong>Slaughter The Drones</strong>Recover the various portions of the city that have gone offline by defeating the drones placed in each of the 4 borough.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras/eab0bfea54bbd1a877a525fe865c1c20.avif?t=1763336336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras_big/eab0bfea54bbd1a877a525fe865c1c20.avif?t=1763336336 width=800 height=448 /></span><br><strong>Travel Uncharted Lands</strong> Collect the late professor's 'Legacy Discs' scattered between the various lands. Solve puzzles, defeat enemies and create alliances in order to uncover the secrets needed to save the land of Orbis.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras/f475920773cf4e77e3dffcfbe5672f5e.avif?t=1763336336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras_big/f475920773cf4e77e3dffcfbe5672f5e.avif?t=1763336336 width=800 height=400 /></span><br><strong>Battle Bosses</strong>With each new land comes its challenges, as you travel to collect the hidden 'Legacies' Left by the professor. Defeat bosses who travel to claim it for themselves. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras/3f20746ed2b30acebcb596ef2207591b.avif?t=1763336336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras_big/3f20746ed2b30acebcb596ef2207591b.avif?t=1763336336 width=800 height=454 /></span><strong>Battle your Ops with Local Versus</strong> <br>Fight to gain true bragging rights in the 1 vs 1 Battle Mode. Fight 1 versus 1 with a friend in the local multiplayer mode and battle on 1 of the five stages. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras/9a78e711f0fde8525482644c6d91c6b9.avif?t=1763336336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379460/extras_big/9a78e711f0fde8525482644c6d91c6b9.avif?t=1763336336 width=800 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Features </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles through the main story </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Bosses through Story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the different city boroughs and collect items to progress the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against friends in the Local Multiplayer Battle Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Embark on the Crisis Story</strong></i> - <br>Play the main story of Azer and travel through several stages, fight against enemies, talk with the locals, solve puzzles and rebuild the support of your team. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com